before:
A larger shadow changes the paint, not the card’s 108 by 48 border box or the next block’s position.
```css
.demo { writing-mode: horizontal-tb; direction: ltr; }
.card { box-sizing: content-box; width: 100px; height: 40px; border: 4px solid teal; box-shadow: 16px 16px 0 gray; } .after { height: 20px; }
```

after:
This card uses a 4-pixel border and a sharp shadow.

```css
.card {
  box-sizing: content-box;
  width: 100px;
  height: 40px;
  border: 4px solid teal;
  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 gray;
}
```

With `content-box`, the width and height measure the content only. The borders make the full box 108 pixels wide and 48 pixels tall.
